{"3230260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Grow Wild", "steam_appid": 3230260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Wild is a cosy relaxing nature game where you grow real-life plants and trees to attract wildlife.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll join the Grow Wild Nature Club and travel the globe transforming empty landscapes into thriving biodiverse ecosystems using real ecological principles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exuberant Professor Vicky Sponge will guide you on your adventure across 5 biomes as you rewild 15 diverse landscapes, discover 300 species, and witness how small actions grow into lasting ecological change and climate stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll look at lizards, pick up pine cones, balance biomes, photograph falcons, sow seeds, trim trees, follow a frog, hide in a bush, surprise a snake, wait for a weasel, chat about chiff chaffs, and experience the magic, joy, and wonder of the natural world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/2285253fcc54c1c3c3faa06c90513601.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for bees buzzing in foxglove, crows nesting high in ash trees, moths fluttering in the dark, snakes hiding under rocks, or spiders weaving webs in tall grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/1e1c9dc4c072e9ad2d2378adef10d134.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know every plant and creature in your nature book, understand what they need to thrive, and see how they fit into the wider ecosystem and food web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/2764f858901b1fc3339af1d07212aca7.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for seeds and start growing habitats — plant wildflowers, build log piles, and create the perfect conditions to welcome new wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBSERVE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/fed51c3b553bcaaf560f120cd4c8801e.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and relax as your ecosystem comes to life - even when you’re not playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Simulated Ecosystem</strong> - Everything in the game is simulated and interconnected, from thousands of sun rays changing tree growth, nectar levels in flowers, animal life cycles, seasons, weather systems, and day night cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Peaceful Sandbox Experience</strong> - Create thriving habitats at your own pace, however you choose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent World</strong> - Your habitats evolve and grow even when you’re not playing. The game time is 100x faster than real-world time, so if you come back one day later 100 days will have passed in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Species</strong> - Discover and learn about over 300 plants and animals within 5 biomes - each with unique needs and behaviours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Real-Life Nature Conservation</strong> - This game is created by Philip Sinclair who has been growing and building real wildlife habitats for over 15 years in the UK countryside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for learning</strong> - Strongly aligned with school science learning objectives - teaching biodiversity and ecosystems through play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone called Sid</strong> - A fellow nature fan who’s always nearby to help - or accidentally scare off a butterfly you’re about to identify!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/6171da1bf196dad27414e10db993e1e1.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow Wild is a cosy relaxing nature game where you grow real-life plants and trees to attract wildlife.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll join the Grow Wild Nature Club and travel the globe transforming empty landscapes into thriving biodiverse ecosystems using real ecological principles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exuberant Professor Vicky Sponge will guide you on your adventure across 5 biomes as you rewild 15 diverse landscapes, discover 300 species, and witness how small actions grow into lasting ecological change and climate stability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’ll look at lizards, pick up pine cones, balance biomes, photograph falcons, sow seeds, trim trees, follow a frog, hide in a bush, surprise a snake, wait for a weasel, chat about chiff chaffs, and experience the magic, joy, and wonder of the natural world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/2285253fcc54c1c3c3faa06c90513601.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for bees buzzing in foxglove, crows nesting high in ash trees, moths fluttering in the dark, snakes hiding under rocks, or spiders weaving webs in tall grass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LEARN<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/1e1c9dc4c072e9ad2d2378adef10d134.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know every plant and creature in your nature book, understand what they need to thrive, and see how they fit into the wider ecosystem and food web.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/2764f858901b1fc3339af1d07212aca7.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forage for seeds and start growing habitats — plant wildflowers, build log piles, and create the perfect conditions to welcome new wildlife.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBSERVE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/fed51c3b553bcaaf560f120cd4c8801e.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back and relax as your ecosystem comes to life - even when you’re not playing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Simulated Ecosystem</strong> - Everything in the game is simulated and interconnected, from thousands of sun rays changing tree growth, nectar levels in flowers, animal life cycles, seasons, weather systems, and day night cycles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Peaceful Sandbox Experience</strong> - Create thriving habitats at your own pace, however you choose</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent World</strong> - Your habitats evolve and grow even when you’re not playing. The game time is 100x faster than real-world time, so if you come back one day later 100 days will have passed in the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-World Species</strong> - Discover and learn about over 300 plants and animals within 5 biomes - each with unique needs and behaviours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by Real-Life Nature Conservation</strong> - This game is created by Philip Sinclair who has been growing and building real wildlife habitats for over 15 years in the UK countryside</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for learning</strong> - Strongly aligned with school science learning objectives - teaching biodiversity and ecosystems through play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Someone called Sid</strong> - A fellow nature fan who’s always nearby to help - or accidentally scare off a butterfly you’re about to identify!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/extras/6171da1bf196dad27414e10db993e1e1.avif?t=1781088697\" width=800 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>", "short_description": "Grow Wild is a cosy nature game where you grow real-life plants and trees, create thriving ecosystems, discover hundreds of creatures, and help rewild the world!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3230260/c4b6c61bc859a0fcbe4232c522df8fe72048f657/header.j